  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>(218 fotos) Carmen Cerd&aacute; Encinas i Balma Ortells Prades han sigut proclamades la vesprada d&#39;aquest divendres reina major i infantil, respectivament, del barri de la Moreria a Onda, en el primer dia de les festes. &Aacute;ngela Cort&eacute;s Naches &eacute;s la dama de Carmen. Ha actuat de mantenidor el ve&iacute; del barri Antonio Feliu Ferrando.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/04/PresenReinesBarriMoreriaOnda18.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Les festes es desenvoluparan fins diumenge 15 d&#39;abril.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentacioreginamoreria18/img_7158.jpg\" alt=\"img_7158\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentacioreginamoreria18/img_7159.jpg\" alt=\"img_7159\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentacioreginamoreria18/img_7160.jpg\" alt=\"img_7160\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentacioreginamoreria18/img_7161.jpg\" alt=\"img_7161\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentacioreginamoreria18/img_7162.jpg\" alt=\"img_7162\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentacioreginamoreria18/img_7163.jpg\" alt=\"img_7163\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentacioreginamoreria18/img_7165.jpg\" alt=\"img_7165\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presentacioreginamoreria18/img_7166.jpg\" alt=\"img_7166\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /